SO-101 6DoF Wrist Upgrade — simulation assets
Copyright (c) 2025 Danqing Zhang / PathOn Robotics

This directory contains a robot model assembled from two sources.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Upstream: SO-ARM100 / SO-101
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following meshes describe the body of the SO-101 arm and are derived from
the SO-ARM100 project by The Robot Studio:

    meshes/base_link.stl
    meshes/shoulder_link_1.stl
    meshes/upper_arm_link_1.stl
    meshes/lower_arm_link_1.stl

    Source:  https://github.com/TheRobotStudio/SO-ARM100
    License: Apache License 2.0

A copy of the Apache License 2.0 is in LICENSE-APACHE-2.0 alongside this file.

Modifications by PathOn Robotics: the parts were re-exported from a combined
CAD assembly of the SO-101 with the 6DoF wrist upgrade and symmetric gripper.
Meshes may differ from upstream in tessellation, units, and origin placement to
match the URDF and MJCF in this directory.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PathOn Robotics original work
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The remaining meshes are original designs by PathOn Robotics:

    meshes/link_pitch_1.stl      wrist pitch link
    meshes/link_yaw_v1_1.stl     wrist yaw link
    meshes/link_roll_v1_1.stl    roll link
    meshes/left_jaw_v1_1.stl     symmetric gripper jaw
    meshes/right_jaw_v1_1.stl    symmetric gripper jaw

    so101_PathonAI_6dof_symmetric_gripper.urdf
    so101_PathonAI_6dof_symmetric_gripper.xml

These are covered by the hardware LICENSE at the root of hardware/.
